    "accessed": "2026-11-05",
    "method": "Geometry taken from the case's final recruit screen (ui-gacha.cjs) in 1920-unit coordinates; the talent card, rates and pity copy are the case's original fiction.",
    "sampleIds": [
      "gacha-event/03-recruit"
    ],
    "measured": [
